  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMERGENCY SUPPORT SUDENESE MINISTRY OF HEALTH COVID 19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency response funding to GOAL to enhance the capacity of the Sudanese Ministry of Health to respond to COVID-19 in Sudan, with particular focus on the FMoH COVID-19 Treatment Centre in Khartoum. The centre was at full capacity during the peak of the first and second wave in Sudan and still serves as the main COVID-19 referral centre for the entire county.</narrative>
